1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,999
[Music] Glory be always and forever to God the Father, God the Son, and God the Holy Spirit.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,999
We thank Mother Mary for the grace to come to this altar where she appeared alive.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,999
My name is Jeromin. This is my wife Shency. This is my daughter Jewel Maria. We are parishioners of Thalore in Thrissur district.

4
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,999
We have been living in Abu Dhabi for the past four years. My wife and I are working there. My daughter is studying there.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,999
My mother also lives with us.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:47,999
Let me first share about the situation that led me to take the covenant. It was on April 12th that we took the covenant online.

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,999
What led us to that — I’m a software engineer. I was working in a company without any issues.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,999
But by January 2025, I started facing many obstacles in my job.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,999
My entire division was being changed, and the technologies I had been working with were all being replaced.

10
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:14,999
Many obstacles came up, and I ended up in a situation where I had to resign. Though it was with great difficulty,

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,999
I resigned from my job in February. Even while resigning, I had confidence in my heart —

12
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,999
I had to serve a one-month notice period in that company. Within that one month, I thought I could try for another job.

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,999
I had firm faith that I would definitely get another job.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,999
That’s how the situation to resign came about. So I resigned in February,

15
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,999
and March 5th was my last working day in that company. But till the end of March, I didn’t get any job.

16
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,999
At that time, I was relying only on my own merit.

17
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,999
Like how Fr. Joseph, Brother Vijay, the other priests and sisters here always say — we were completely depending on our merit.

18
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:57,999
At that time, we didn’t give any space for God to work or for Mother Mary to intercede.

19
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,999
I came to realize that. Then on April 10th, I reached a point of deep struggle due to not getting a job.

20
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,999
It became a situation where we all fell into great distress.

21
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,999
On that day, my mother — who stays with me — suggested that we take the Marian Covenant at Kreupasanam.

22
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,999
We completely believed in that suggestion. Back in October 2024,

23
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,999
after Sunday Mass, we had received a Kreupasanam magazine. Whenever someone comes home on vacation,

24
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,999
they bring the magazine from Kerala, and we distribute it among others. That’s how it reached us

25
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:36,999
Usually, we wouldn’t regularly get the Kreupasanam magazine every month,

26
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:41,999
but that October, we happened to receive one. My mother had kept that magazine safely in her bag.

27
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:47,999
She had kept it for about eight months. To be honest, we hadn’t even read it.

28
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:52,999
We hadn’t read any of the testimonies in it, we hadn’t watched any testimonies either. Even though we had

29
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:57,999
heard about Kreupasanam while in Kerala, we had never really tried to know more about it,

30
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:03,999
or tried to understand what the Covenant was. But when my mother suggested taking the Covenant,

31
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:09,999
my wife and I immediately said “okay,” because by then, it was clear that relying on our own merit wasn’t enough.

32
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:16,999
We had truly come to feel that. So, on April 12th — the Saturday night before Divine Mercy Sunday — we took the Covenant online.

33
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:24,999
And from April 13th, we began living the Covenant life. And from that, we received two physical blessings

34
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,999
and one spiritual blessing. The first testimony we received was healing for my daughter Jewel Maria.

35
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,999
Regarding my daughter — every month or every couple of months, she would regularly get fever.

36
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:40,999
Sometimes every two weeks. If she went to school, the next day she would have a fever.

37
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:46,999
Fever, then antibiotics, sometimes even hospitalization. This was a pattern that had been

38
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:51,999
continuing for about one and a half to two years. We had taken her to multiple doctors.

39
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:57,999
For the past one year, we were going for check-ups regularly every two months. And in those check-ups,

40
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:03,999
the doctor said that her adenoid gland was extremely enlarged — that’s why she was getting frequent colds and fevers.

41
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:08,999
And for over a year, the gland was not reducing in size. Every check-up, it remained the same.

42
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:19,999
But after we started living the Covenant life from April 13th — with daily prayer, Covenant prayers,

43
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:23,999
scripture reading, and Holy Mass — we entered into that track.

44
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:30,999
On the seventh day, which was Holy Saturday, she had her next doctor’s appointment.

45
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:36,999
There’s a reason for that appointment. When we returned to Abu Dhabi after our leave in January,

46
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:41,999
we had been trying to get an appointment for her since then. For two months,

47
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,999
we kept trying but couldn’t get one. There were various obstacles — sometimes the doctor would be on leave,

48
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:44,999
or we’d be given a different doctor’s appointment. So many hurdles kept happening.

49
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:49,999
or we’d be given a different doctor’s appointment. So many hurdles kept happening.

50
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:55,999
But after taking the Covenant, when my wife tried again, we immediately got an appointment exactly on Holy Saturday — the seventh day.

51
00:04:56,000 --> 00:05:00,999
Right then, we had this inner conviction that Mother Mary had begun her intercession.

52
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:04,999
We began to realize that something divine had started working.

53
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:09,999
From the moment we took the Covenant, we had a deep human longing —

54
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:15,999
to receive a sign. We had seen many testimonies where people saw a rainbow, or Mother Mary’s image in a candle,

55
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:20,999
or experienced heavenly fragrance. We too intensely desired and prayed for

56
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:27,999
such a sign. And as a result, on Good Friday, the sixth day of the Covenant,

57
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:33,999
after completing all our prayers, including the visible (manifestation) prayer, we blew out the candles. After an hour or two,

58
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:37,999
when we looked at them, we could clearly see Mother Mary’s image formed in one of the candles.

59
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:42,999
That’s when we understood that Mother was truly about to do something miraculous in our lives through the Covenant.

60
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:48,999
We had firm faith. My wife believed wholeheartedly. When we were going to meet the consultant doctor again,

61
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:53,999
she wished for all the tests to be redone — to verify and confirm that there were no issues left in our daughter.

62
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:58,999
That’s what she prayed for, and as a result, after that image of Mother appeared, the very next day — Holy Saturday —

63
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:04,999
we met the doctor. The doctor conducted all the tests we had hoped for.

64
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:11,999
Everything came back normal. The previously enlarged adenoid gland in our daughter had shrunk. Surgery was no longer needed.

65
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:16,999
Earlier, the doctor had said surgery was absolutely necessary. They had also warned that if this continued,

66
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:22,999
fluid might collect in the ear, leading to frequent infections, and that it could eventually lead to hearing loss.

67
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:29,999
We were really worried. But all that tension vanished after that day.

68
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:34,999
The doctor said, “No surgery is needed now. It’s shrinking.

69
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:40,999
Just give her vitamin tablets — that will be enough, and she’ll be fine.”

70
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:45,999
And since then, our daughter hasn’t had any fever or trouble because of the adenoid issue.

71
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:51,999
This was the first blessing we received. This healing of our daughter was our first

72
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,999
testimony from the Covenant — a divine assignment in our lives.

73
00:06:56,000 --> 00:07:00,999
Secondly, it was about my job. After I left in March, we took the Covenant in April.

74
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:06,999
After taking the Covenant, I began watching many of Fr. Joseph’s retreats, Brother Vijay’s talks, and several testimonies.

75
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:11,999
That’s when the phrase “Not by merit, but by grace” started deeply touching our hearts.

76
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:19,999
I surrendered everything and began to pray. Honestly, at that time, I received a special grace —

77
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:24,999
a grace to move forward relying solely on prayer. Before that, I had attended many interviews.

78
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:29,999
In all those interviews, I was mostly depending on my own merit and preparing accordingly.

79
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:33,999
My focus had been more on interview preparation. But after taking the Covenant,

80
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,999
I shifted my concentration more toward prayer. I began to focus deeply on prayer,

81
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:47,999
fully surrendered to God, and moved forward with trust in Him. During that time, I had applied to about a hundred

82
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:51,999
jobs through various job search websites. But from all that, I received only two or three calls.

83
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:57,999
I also told some of my old colleagues in the UAE to let me know if there were any job opportunities.

84
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:03,999
Even with all that, I got around six or seven interviews. But in all those interviews,

85
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:07,999
I was rejected. We began to understand that some kind of spiritual hindrance was blocking me —

86
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:12,999
something was standing in the way, and it had to be removed. We became aware of that.

87
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:17,999
In IT jobs, as some may know, interviews can sometimes go up to six or seven rounds.

88
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:21,999
The hiring company might conduct four rounds of interviews. After that,

89
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,999
the client side may again conduct three or four more rounds. Altogether,

90
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,999
it could go up to eight rounds — some hiring drives are like that.

91
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:33,999
I remember Fr. Joseph always saying that Mother Mary works in two ways in our Covenant:

92
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:38,999
either by shortening the time or by making things light. In my job testimony,

93
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:43,999
I truly believe Mother worked by making things light.

94
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,999
That’s where I deeply feel her intercession. I had especially prayed that

95
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:53,999
I should not have to go through 7 or 8 rounds of interviews — that I should get a job with just 1 or 2 rounds.

96
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:58,999
That was my sincere prayer. Also, in IT interviews, we may be asked technical theory questions,

97
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,999
or practical hands-on problems. When all these are involved,

98
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,999
the chances of rejection become quite high.

99
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,999
So I prayed specifically that I shouldn't be asked any practical questions — I should only be asked things I could handle in theory.

100
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,999
I prayed that everything should go smoothly.

101
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,999
And then April passed, and it became May.

102
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:21,999
In between that time, my wife saw Mother Mary and also Fr. Joseph in her dreams once or twice.

103
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:30,999
My wife believed that if we were going to receive a blessing like this, Mother Mary would surely give us a sign beforehand. I had mentioned the matter of the candle before —

104
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:36,999
and similarly, after May 20th or so, one day when my wife was returning after Holy Mass at church,

105
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,999
she saw a few people standing there with an image of Mother Mary.

106
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:45,999
She went and asked them, “What is this about?” and they responded by asking her,

107
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:52,999
“Will you receive Mother Mary?”

108
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:57,999
At first, my wife didn’t understand, but she said “Okay” anyway. They were actually members of the Legion of Mary.

109
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:04,999
They told her that if we were interested, they could give us the statue of Mother Mary for 10 to 12 days to pray with at home.

110
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:08,999
After those days of prayer, they would come back and take it to the next family.

111
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:14,999
Even though we had been going to church for four years, this had never happened to us before.

112
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:19,999
This was the first time — and it happened after we made the Covenant.

113
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:23,999
So we believed it was truly Mother Mary’s doing.

114
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,999
On May 24, they brought the statue of Mother Mary into our home.

115
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:31,999
From that day, we began praying the full Rosary daily before Mother Mary.

116
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:36,999
We truly believed Mother had arrived and given us the next sign.

117
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:40,999
Naturally, we assumed that the next blessing would be related to my job.

118
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:47,999
So we started praying with specific dates in mind — just like we heard in the testimonies.

119
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:52,999
Since May is the month of Mother Mary, we prayed that by May 31

120
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:57,999
I would get a job, and specifically that I would receive an offer letter before May 30.

121
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,999
But until May 29, all the interviews I had attended had ended in rejections. Nothing was moving.

122
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:10,999
By May 29, there were only two days left. And then on May 29, something happened —

123
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:13,999
Earlier in March, I had reached out to a former colleague about any possible job openings.

124
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:18,999
That colleague called me on May 29 and said there was an opportunity available.

125
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:25,999
On the 29th, he said that there was an option. But he also said that although the company he worked for was ready to give me an offer,

126
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:30,999
it depended on a client interview for the project I’d be joining. That interview could go through one, two, three, or even four rounds.

127
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:35,999
Only if I cleared that would they be able to issue me the offer letter. So I prayed.

128
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:42,999
And then the interview itself got scheduled for May 29th itself.

129
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:55,999
Since we had made the covenant online, we didn’t have any physical holy objects with us — what we had was faith, our Kreupasanam newsletter, and a photo of Mother Mary.

130
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,999
So I kept those near me during the interview and prayed to Mother Mary:

131
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:05,999
“Please let them ask only questions that I already know. Let me be able to answer them well.

132
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:12,999
Please make it light-weight. Let there be no extra rounds. No practical tests.”

133
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,999
And to my amazement — there was only one round of interview with the client.

134
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:21,999
The client was a major company — a multinational airline based in Abu Dhabi.

135
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:26,999
The interview was just one round — and it lasted only 15 minutes.

136
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:33,999
Normally, even a single round can last an hour. But this one was just 15 minutes,

137
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:39,999
and they asked me only four or five questions, and I was able to answer all of them.

138
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:45,999
And on that same day, May 29, they told me that I was selected and the company would issue the offer letter.

139
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:49,999
I received the offer letter on May 30.

140
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,999
So everything happened between May 29 and May 30.

141
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:57,999
Mother Mary takes it very seriously — she gives it utmost importance.

142
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:02,999
All of this happened within just two days.

143
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:07,999
These first two testimonies were material blessings.

144
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:13,999
the spiritual transformation that came into our lives.

145
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:21,999
My wife and I are still young. We're not very old.

146
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:26,999
Like most young people today, we used to spend a lot of time on our phones —

147
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:29,999
especially watching mobile shorts and videos.

148
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:36,999
When my mother, or my wife’s mother, used to tell us to pray —

149
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:41,999
During that time, we mostly relied on online Mass.

150
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:45,999
Especially during the COVID period, we switched to online Mass, and after that,

151
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:49,999
we hadn’t really come out of that mode.

152
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:53,999
That was the kind of thinking we had.

153
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:59,999
like if our daughter had some health issue, we would skip Mass saying that.

154
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:05,999
We had started making excuses just to stick to watching it online.

155
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:11,999
But after making the covenant, one of the biggest transformations that happened in our lives is this:

156
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:17,999
Every day, all four of us now go for Holy Mass.

157
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:22,999
We live in Abu Dhabi, and we go in person for Mass — we attend, receive the Holy Eucharist.

158
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:26,999
Also, every two weeks, our whole family goes for confession.

159
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:31,999
I was someone who went to confession once a year — or maybe once every two years.

160
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:36,999
That was the kind of life I was living.

161
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:40,999
But now, if I feel I’ve done even one or two wrong things,

162
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:44,999
That’s a huge change in my heart.

163
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:53,999
after Mother Mary's image came into our house, that’s when we came to know fully about the complete rosary.

164
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:57,999
Before that, even though we heard it mentioned in testimonies, we didn’t really know what the full rosary was.

165
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:03,999
We learned more about it, and from that day onward, in our family prayer, we started praying the full rosary — without fail.

166
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:09,999
Earlier, when a prayer would go beyond 30 minutes, we used to get frustrated.

167
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:13,999
But now, when the full rosary and our prayers go on for an hour or even an hour and a half,

168
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,999
we feel no frustration or difficulty at all.

169
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,999
Personally, too, we’ve become much more connected to the full rosary.

170
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:25,999
As Joseph Achan often says, this covenant helped people like us who were off track to get back on track.

171
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:30,999
Before this, I never used to pray the Way of the Cross, or say vocal prayers consistently.

172
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:35,999
But now we pray the Way of the Cross regularly, we say our prayers aloud.

173
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,999
And because of this, our life has come into a beautiful order — spiritually and materially.

174
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:47,999
To explain about evangelism, sometimes when someone comes to the newsletter, they bring the newsletters there, and we get the newsletters from them.

175
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:51,999
That was an option we had more often. Then, we heard a testimony like this — a brother and sister in the USA said they had great difficulty obtaining such newsletters.

176
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:55,999
When they finally got a newsletter, they printed it themselves, and from that, they got a digital copy.

177
00:15:56,000 --> 00:16:03,999
They printed it and distributed it themselves, according to their testimony. Similarly, we —

178
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:09,999
after taking the covenant along with online resources, now we are in the third month. For the first two months, we did it this way: we would receive the monthly leaflet,

179
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:14,999
print it ourselves, and distribute it.

180
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:19,999
We are also regular viewers of Father’s Daily Bread, which we watch regularly. We share it on YouTube as well.

181
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:24,999
We mostly watch the covenant meditations live, and we share testimonies there too.

182
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:31,999
Notably, I was not very involved in social media or such thing

183
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,999
I was a person who wasn’t particularly involved in these things. That is, I rarely shared anything at all.

184
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:46,999
Neither did I share our physical or spiritual matters. Before, whenever someone shared a spiritual message, I used to think, “Why is this being shared now?” — such thoughts used to come to my mind.

185
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:51,999
But now, I myself have formed a group, and I have received the grace to share these matters.

186
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:57,999
We understand that all this is pleasing to Jesus and Mother Mary, and that we are participating in a missionary activity.

187
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:02,999
We have gained this good understanding and have been able to carry it out. Similarly, we also do charitable works.

188
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,999
Even before taking this covenant, we were helping orphanages as much as we could financially.

189
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:12,999
Not only there — we had contacts in orphanages back home and were supporting them.

190
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:17,999
Recently, about a month ago, we began regularly attending this church, and then we connected with the Jesus Youths organization there.

191
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:22,999
When they get details about people who are struggling financially or can’t afford books for their children’s education,

192
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:27,999
they share those details with us on WhatsApp.

193
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:31,999
Then we visit them, help as much as we can, and try to provide all necessary assistance.

194
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:35,999
We are continuing this work. This is charity we did.

195
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:40,999
These are the activities we have been doing. Besides all this, recently we had a major experience — a testimony just yesterday.

196
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:51,999
As the scripture says, “Seek first the kingdom and righteousness, and all these things shall be added to you,” we firmly believed and moved forward.

197
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:56,999
This is a testimony of that faith. You all know there is an ongoing war-related problem in the Middle East.

198
00:17:57,000 --> 00:18:04,999
I had obtained my visa and paid for it — it was about one week.

199
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:08,999
But here, there is something called the Emirates ID — an identity card like our Aadhaar card.

200
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:16,999
I hadn’t received mine yet. Only after getting it could I travel locally. Because at the airport, when we go there, they check — a physical card is needed.

201
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:17,999
I hadn’t received it.

202
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,999
But whenever we prayed, I prayed especially that before joining work, I must come and give testimony here.

203
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:31,999
I really wished and prayed to give testimony about my daughter’s health and the job I got, before joining work.

204
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:37,999
But many obstacles came. One by one, those obstacles cleared, but the last obstacle was the war problem.

205
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:41,999
Due to the war, flights got canceled, airports closed — a human being can do nothing there.

206
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:47,999
Only God can intervene in such a situation.

207
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:52,999
I’m not saying the war happened for us, but we believe it was also a reason to increase our faith a little more.

208
00:18:53,000 --> 00:19:02,999
Then yesterday, late in the evening, I got a message from the Emirates side saying my Emirates ID print is done and I will get it soon.

209
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:06,999
But they said it would take 2 to 3 working days. I must join work on the 1st of July.

210
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:15,999
Before that, if I could come home even for 4 days, I would get at least some time to attend the prayer meeting and give testimony.

211
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:19,999
I prayed like that. But if the Emirates ID came only after 2 to 3 days, none of that would be possible.

212
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:25,999
Yet, I firmly believed that somehow Mother Mary would make a way for me.

213
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:30,999
Later, when I contacted the courier service, they told me there was a premium option available.

214
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,999
I had contacted them before as well.

215
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:37,999
But earlier, they never mentioned such an option. However, after contacting and praying this time, when I asked, they said if I took the premium option,

216
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:41,999
I could get the physical Emirates ID today itself.

217
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:45,999
So that day itself, I received the Emirates ID, and we were very happy.

218
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:49,999
That happened just yesterday evening. Then a problem arose in Qatar,

219
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:55,999
followed by war-related difficulties, and the airspace was closed, airports were to be closed —

220
00:19:56,000 --> 00:20:00,999
such a problem came up. We got very tense, but Mother Mary arranged everything.

221
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:05,999
Still, due to these problems, we were unable to go, which caused us a lot of tension.

222
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:11,999
Nevertheless, we firmly believed. Brother Vijay often says in talks —

223
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:17,999
“First believe. Do God’s work first. God will take care of your matters.”

224
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:23,999
We truly believed in that talk.

225
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:28,999
We also believed in the scripture I mentioned earlier —

226
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:28,999
“Everything is possible with God; nothing is impossible.”

227
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:34,999
“Everything is possible with God; nothing is impossible.”

228
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:41,999
news came around two-thirty that the airspace was roughly open again,

229
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:46,999
at least there was a chance for flights to operate today.

230
00:20:47,000 --> 00:20:51,999
We believed this was all a result of God’s intervention.

231
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:57,999
We got the flight, even though it was delayed by four hours, and last night we departed from there.

232
00:20:58,000 --> 00:21:02,999
We arrived early this morning. After reaching home, with the permission of our parents,

233
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:07,999
we came here to give testimony. We have received so many blessings.

234
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:13,999
We thank Jesus and Mother Mary immensely for all the blessings we have received.

235
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:20,999
We had a strong desire to give testimony from this altar where Mother Mary appeared,

236
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:26,999
and it was a great wish to come and testify before my husband starts his new job.

237
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:35,999
We are deeply grateful to Mother Mary for making this possible, and a thousand thanks to Jesus and Mother Mary.

238
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:42,999
As the 12th chapter, 4th verse of the Book of Isaiah says: “Thank the Lord, call upon His name and seek His presence.”

239
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:51,999
"Proclaim the works there among the peoples; declare that His name is exalted,"

240
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:58,999
This brother, along with his life partner and child, with great joy at the feet of the Mother of the Covenant at Kreupasanam,

241
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:09,999
remembers and gives thanks for the blessings received in life. The brother indicated that the reason they initially started with an online covenant

242
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:15,999
was because the child had a health condition related to adenoids. But by relying on Mother Mary

243
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:23,999
and through prayer, although they had been trying for a long time to get a doctor’s appointment,

244
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:31,999
it had not come through. One thing after another delayed the process. He mentioned that they took the covenant on the day of Hossana—

245
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:39,999
Saturday, the 12th. They took the online covenant and prayed. On the ninth day, the 19th,

246
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:48,999
the child got a confirmed appointment with the doctor, underwent all the examinations, and

247
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:54,999
the message the family received was that the child no longer had any adenoid-related illness and could continue with full health as normal.

248
00:22:55,000 --> 00:23:02,999
This greatly encouraged the family and helped them to stand firm in their covenant life with strong desire.

249
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:09,999
The brother said that although he had the Kreupasanam newspaper in his hand for a long time, he had kept it without reading.

250
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:17,999
The healing of the child from the illness, and the grace for the brother to find another job after losing his previous one,

251
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:23,999
was something they had been praying for amidst many continuous obstacles. This is how they came here, took the covenant, and returned.

252
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:30,999
When they took the covenant, they prayed with a set date of May 31, hoping that their job situation would improve by then.

253
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:37,999
The brother said that until the 29th, he had attended numerous interviews and sent many requests,

254
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:44,999
but no job process moved forward anywhere. On the 29th, unexpectedly, he received an interview call

255
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:54,999
which required four, five, or six rounds, but he completed the interview in just 10 to 15 minutes in one round and got the job offer.

256
00:23:55,000 --> 00:24:02,999
The son said this was a testimony of a time miracle, as well as a lightweight testimony,

257
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:10,999
because during those days of great emotional burden, when almost all sources of income had dried up and the future seemed uncertain,

258
00:24:11,000 --> 00:24:18,999
Mother Mary specially intervened in that covenant. From the day they took the covenant, the family unitedly and faithfully

259
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:26,999
offered their life at the feet of the Mother, praying with holiness and trust. That prayer and the acts of mercy

260
00:24:27,000 --> 00:24:32,999
indicated how they were helped. Also, they testify about every sign of blessing they received during the covenant period.

261
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:50,999
They say that while praying and taking the covenant for that job, one day the Legion of Mary’s Mother appeared...

262
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:57,999
They asked if the covenant would be accepted at home, and once accepted at home, they began praying and reciting the full rosary.

263
00:24:58,000 --> 00:25:06,999
From that moment itself, the job matters started to go well, and by the 29th, the job was confirmed and all related matters progressed smoothly.

264
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:13,999
Their earnest desire was to come before the feet of Mother Mary and give testimony before starting the job in July.

265
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:20,999
Due to the Gulf wars and other related issues, including a sudden attack in Qatar which led to closure of the Qatar airspace, their booked tickets were affected.

266
00:25:21,000 --> 00:25:35,999
The brother recalls that it was at the moment the airspace was closed that they remembered the teachings of brother Vijay Kumar Sir — first do what belongs to God, and God will take care of your matters.

267
00:25:36,000 --> 00:25:41,999
They firmly believed this and committed their life to God, no matter how complicated or corrupted their matters were.

268
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:48,999
Even when they saw no solution, Mother Mary and the Holy One arranged everything on their behalf.

269
00:25:49,000 --> 00:26:01,999
They heard about the intensity of the war and how quickly Qatar got involved and closed its airspace.

270
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:08,999
The son mentions that on the very day he arrived at the airport with the ticket, they learned the war had ended, ceasefire declared, and the airspace was opened again.

271
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:17,999
Though slightly delayed, traveling became possible. They traveled late night and reached home by dawn.

272
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:24,999
At the altar, the son expressed gratitude.

273
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:30,999
Dear ones, this is faithfulness in the covenant life.

274
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:38,999
When you hold Mother Mary’s hand, no matter what trouble or big crisis comes, she leads us well forward, removes sufferings, and lightens every burden, brothers said.

275
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:46,999
This is their third testimony, the important one.

276
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:59,999
It is about the changes in their family life — a renewed focus on prayer, a zeal for participating in the Holy Mass, and a desire to read the Word faithfully without interruption.

277
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:07,999
Mother Mary put their young family exactly on track and helped them run straight on that path.

278
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:14,999
They are filled with joy and gratitude towards the Mother.

279
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:21,999
Dear ones, the covenant life leads each of us from twisted paths to straight ways, lightening heavy burdens,

280
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:29,999
and shortens long periods of suffering into moments of grace.

281
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:35,999
Every moment, this is the essence of the testimony shared here at the altar, and how our lives are entrusted to Mother Mary.

282
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:41,999
Let us pray for this family and thank Mother Mary and Jesus for every blessing received here.

283
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:48,999
Let us clap our hands and present this testimony.

284
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:56,999
May these extraordinary divine experiences be yours as well.

285
00:27:57,000 --> 00:28:04,999
If you have not yet subscribed to this YouTube channel, subscribe now.

286
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:09,000
Share this video with your friends and become one of the Lord’s messengers.
